  <title>JC — Official Learning Outcomes (Appendices A–E)</title>
  <chapter xml:id="jc-official-unifying">
    <title>Appendix A — Unifying Strand</title>
    <introduction>
      <p>This is a reference to the original published Junior Cycle Mathematics specification. The source wording, symbols and level distinctions are preserved in the original document. The reader provides larger type, zoom and a reformatted reading view alongside the unchanged original.</p>
      <p>Where outcomes are bold in the original specification, that indicates additional Higher Level material. Keep that distinction when consulting the original.</p>
    </introduction>
    <section xml:id="jc-official-unifying-reader">
      <title>Read the official outcomes</title>
      <p><url href="https://ronandownes.github.io/book/syllabus/reader.html?course=jc&amp;strand=unifying" visual="Open the large-text, zoomable strand reader in a new page"/>. It opens at the beginning of this strand and lets you move through its pages.</p>
      <p><url href="https://www.curriculumonline.ie/getmedia/6a7f1ff5-9b9e-4d71-8e1f-6d4f932191db/JC_Mathematics_Specification.pdf#page=14&amp;zoom=160" visual="Open the unchanged NCCA source at page 14"/>. Source acknowledgement: National Council for Curriculum and Assessment (NCCA), curriculumonline.ie, copyright retained by the NCCA.</p>
      <figure xml:id="jc-official-unifying-figure">
        <caption>Unifying Strand: NCCA source viewed through the accessible reader. The original PDF remains authoritative for mathematical notation and level distinctions.</caption>
        <interactive xml:id="jc-official-unifying-interactive" iframe="https://ronandownes.github.io/book/syllabus/reader.html?course=jc&amp;strand=unifying" width="100%" aspect="4:5"/>
